    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12062" root="دبق" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَبُوقَآءُ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِبْقٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Anything sticky,
glutinous, viscous,</i> or <i>ropy; that draws out with
a sticky, glutinous, viscous,</i> or <i>ropy, continuity of
parts.</i> (IDrd, K, * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>Human ordure;</i>
(JK, S, K;) because of its sticky, or ropy,
quality. (JK.)

